 ('Rajgir','Bihar','Vulture Peak, Venuvan, Vishwa Shanti Stupa','A landscape of hills and sacred places closely connected with the Buddha’s teaching years.','rajgir'),
 ('Nalanda','Bihar','Nalanda Mahavihara ruins, archaeological museum','Explore the remains of one of the ancient world’s great centres of Buddhist learning.','nalanda'),
 ('Vaishali','Bihar','Ashokan pillar, relic stupa, Kolhua','An important stop in the Buddhist circuit, with archaeological remains and traditions linked to the Buddha’s visits.','vaishali'),
 ('Kesariya','Bihar','Kesariya Buddhist Stupa','A monumental brick stupa that can be included when travelling between the Vaishali region and Kushinagar.','kesariya'),
